{"type":"text","timestamp":1794546939899,"sessionID":"ses_e2cad0faaffebn7YTy42utMRho","part":{"id":"prt_1d3552e86002i5G8VGfOxeplnW","sessionID":"ses_e2cad0faaffebn7YTy42utMRho","messageID":"msg_1d35513a6001At30KP9cxErNCA","type":"text","text":"Reading complete. Pre-write pass: this extends `parseOptions`/`selectMode`/`backfillLog` in place (cheapest move past \"build nothing\"). Building nothing fails because the 144-line committed log must be re-scored for delivery without replaying offers, and `backfillRunLog` already accepts `briefOnly` — only the CLI lacks the switch. The only caller is `main`, and the flag is optional, so no shared contract breaks.","time":{"start":1794546937478,"end":1794546939899}}}
